<p>2nd Police District Council, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions on Oct. 23, 2026 for reelection. No campaign website or platform found.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>2nd District Council member, listed by CCPSA under community engagement. Worked seven years in public service in Aurora, in the mayor&#39;s office communications department and as director of community affairs for the West Aurora School District; a cannabis industry social equity applicant who moved to Chicago in 2017 and has worked with Chicago NORML and Equity and Transformation. BA from Columbia College Chicago and MBA from Aurora University.</p>
